{"id":"wb-7-166","name":"田螺山遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"田螺山遗址","text":"田螺山遗址是属于河姆渡文化的一处古遗址，位于浙江省余姚市三七市镇相岙村，发现于2001年，曾入选“2008年中国十大考古新发现”初选名单。经考古证实，遗址年代约为距今7000年-5500年。由于其地面环境、地下遗存保存较为完好，被称为“第二河姆渡”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%B0%E8%9E%BA%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":84932730,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84932730","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/82495176efda63072226e3c9.jpg","title":"Tianluoshan_Site,_2014-11-23_06.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tianluoshan_Site,_2014-11-23_06.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Tianluoshan_Site%2C_2014-11-23_06.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​余姚田螺山遗址","width":320,"height":213}}